{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219","ja":"撮影開始","zh":"开始拍摄","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2a4c01125aef20d3a9451f3944889fdafd447b3c6073544bf493fc908bad6881","ja":"「最初はちょっとビックリしたけど、\nこのマフィン、めっちゃ美味いな！」","zh":"“虽然一开始有点被吓到了，\n但这松饼真的太好吃啦！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1e17847a4af9d4c5d2c60c96b637475fe6fcdecb8bf8a4300514d262633b4c6b","ja":"「私のは、チョコが横から刺さっちゃってるけど、\nこれはこれで愛嬌があって可愛いわ！」","zh":"“虽然我这个的巧克力从侧面插进去了，\n不过这样也别有一番可爱之处呢！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d359820db5889166658a340d38fa36e5aa2caca20f563f246bd77bbbca1fc20e","ja":"うぅ……ぐちゃぐちゃデコレーションのマフィン、\nスタッフさんたちにも、笑われちゃってる……。","zh":"呜呜……装饰得一塌糊涂的玛芬蛋糕，\n连工作人员们看了，也都在笑我……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"10e1677e095b2717b58dd0c7c879ea26da4a7a0d150738909a42bb4bbe949dad","ja":"ですが、味は大好評かと。\n実際、春香のまふぃんはとても良い出来です。","zh":"但是，味道大受好评。\n实际上，春香做的马芬相当成功。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"170e0a521aa9699f24863c8c5285194636c2c7ac0d7deb59171876f7b4e60ad8","ja":"ふんだんにばたーを使いつつ、甘すぎない味に仕上げ、\n口当たりもしっとりとしていて……真、美味です♪","zh":"用料十足地加入了黄油，做成甜而不腻的口感，\n吃起来也十分湿润绵密……真是美味至极♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fda4536bf2fb4c973ed235194b36450a652fd3fbf16076c0c80e420a18cd2c99","ja":"見た目でみんなを笑顔にさせて、\n味で気持ちを落ち着かせたんだから、大成功じゃない♪","zh":"光是外表就逗笑了大家，\n味道又让心情平静了下来，这不是大成功嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d2b57fc57a0dd559d08c962bb7d9d586698e6a33431d5695a37b086a4e8252bc","ja":"うん。機材トラブルも何とかなりそうだし。","zh":"嗯。器材故障看起来也总算能解决了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"34e8a37dd067bc39a127909608f70cfd9e8ed270c99c2202ab426f4263a6d04d","ja":"一時はどうなることかと思ったけど……\n今の空気なら、気持ちよく撮影できそうね。","zh":"一度还不知道会变成什么样呢……\n按现在的气氛，应该能心情舒畅地进行拍摄了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6946e8deffa246caea4e9e718ce271fc5516dfe6084c2e14be7f79ae77719977","ja":"春香ちゃん、本当にありがとう！","zh":"春香，真的很谢谢你！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"410a1a8328728928f38669dc37be475356afb93ad4320fd3a78d01f0acdf2ff6","ja":"……えへへ。\nみんなの笑顔を取り戻せたのなら、よかったのかな♪","zh":"……嘿嘿。\n如果能找回大家的笑容，那就太好了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"700dc42b2a54bfaa8d568667aae187cf0dd2e5ef6526227ae17a54777524ca7a","ja":"真、素晴らしい働きでした。\n春香のまふぃんが、皆の心を和ませてくれたのです。","zh":"真，干得真漂亮。\n春香的马芬蛋糕，温暖了大家的心灵呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"62a0cb1b2b8fee9e114475db3dcf53808aa5a607c1734be65bc99948fc7945c1","ja":"私はマフィンを作ってきただけ、なんだけどな～。\n……あっ！　撮影準備ができたみたい！","zh":"我只是做了玛芬蛋糕带过来而已呀～。\n……啊！拍摄好像准备好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3626aac6f63cfe526d98e1e4864e8f457e94ead870b513357bceed4d4082dc26","ja":"では、ここからは気を引き締めて参りましょう。","zh":"那么，接下来就让我们打起精神来吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1498.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"567f380d98e8ee639eba27f7ade800f2de034f35c6e5d35cd58304589ef43306","ja":"それじゃあみなさん、\nよろしくお願いしま～す♪","zh":"那么大家，\n拜托各位啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
